[[Image:Isle of Dread.jpg|thumb|Isle of Dread]]

The '''Isle of Dread''' {{co|30|80|Feralas}} is located south of [[Feathermoon Stronghold]]. It is home to many level 60-62 elite [[chimaera]]. One notable chimaera, [[Lord Lakmaeran]], is part of the quest line for the [[Scepter of the Shifting Sands]].

The isle is also home to a group of [[naga]] who dwell in a cave at the northern end. They are led by [[Lord Shalzaru]] whom players are asked to kill as a quest for [[Feathermoon Stronghold]]. The cave itself seems to be completely unique in design and goes quite deep — there is a secret underwater passageway that leads into an inner chamber, but it has no apparent special uses besides being the location in which [[Lady Szallah]] resides. The only entrance to the central walley is in the southeastern part of the island - from all other sides the central walley is inacessible due to unyielding cliffs.

==Lore==
{{Warcraft III}}
[[Centaur]]s once allied with a trio of [[bronze dragon]]s and were the uncontested rulers of this island. The tileset is called "Barrens".

